<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - NatWest upgrades ICI to add.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NatWest upgrades ICI to add.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts at NatWest Securities on Tuesday upgraded ICI Plc to &quot;add&quot; from &quot;hold&quot;, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Shares in ICI were up 5p to 10.25 stg by 0930 GMT. No further details were given and the analyst was unavailable for immediate comment.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
